{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "name": "review-informed-general-home-photo-v3",
  "description": "Review V2 with beak removed for low search usefulness, not necessarily visual incorrectness. Retains all original 234 concepts and thirteen additions. This remains an experimental vocabulary, not a validated general-purpose taxonomy.",
  "reviewPolicy": "Prefer useful subjects and scenes over redundant subject parts. Preserve historical correctness judgments even when a concept is excluded for usefulness. Reuse explicit, non-conflicting exact photo/tag judgments. Retain independently predicted bird; never rewrite a beak prediction into bird.",
